# Line endings: normalized to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Windows tooling rewrites files with CRLF, which makes clean files read as
# modified. In this repo that matters for two reasons beyond cosmetics: the
# frozen source snapshots under data/raw/ are the credibility anchor for the
# realism audits, and a whitespace-only diff staged by accident is exactly the
# failure the PreToolUse hook exists to refuse.
#
# Declared before the first commit, so no renormalization commit is ever needed.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never examined for line endings, never normalized.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db   binary
*.duckdb binary
*.sqlite binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
